# Decisions Log

## 2026-06-28 07:42:14 — Codex
Decision recorded: Use nginx plus a remotely managed Cloudflare Tunnel for `langfuse.adaptdev.ai` because no local origin certificate/key was present. Use a custom `langfuse-cloudflared.service` with `--token-file` so the tunnel token is not exposed in process arguments. Use a dedicated Redis service on `127.0.0.1:6380` and `REDIS_CONNECTION_STRING` to avoid the existing Dragonfly service on `6379` and Langfuse's missing-Redis-auth coercion path. Keep R2 configured in Langfuse env but mark blob verification blocked by Cloudflare account state until R2 is enabled.

